From: Dallas Delaney <dadelan@microsoft.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 03:26:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] erofs: consume signed dm-verity tar indexes

Discover replacement tar-index bundles, reconstruct each EROFS device from the source tar stream, and verify the fixed dm-verity contract before use.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
